# Default surfaces only

Cards and surfaces in this app use the **default** surface variant only. Do not use `secondary` or `tertiary` for layout panels, cards, or surface backgrounds.

## Do

- Group content with `SurfaceCard` from `@/components/surface-card` (always default).
- Use `bg-surface` for small surface-like elements (icon circles, toggle buttons).
- Use `Surface` from `heroui-native` with `variant="default"` if needed directly.

## Don't

- Pass `variant="secondary"` or `variant="tertiary"` to `SurfaceCard`, `Surface`, or `ListGroup`.
- Use `bg-surface-secondary`, `bg-surface-tertiary`, or related foreground tokens for cards/panels.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<SurfaceCard variant="secondary" className="p-4">...</SurfaceCard>
<View className="bg-surface-secondary rounded-2xl p-4">...</View>

// ✅ GOOD
<SurfaceCard className="p-4">...</SurfaceCard>
<View className="bg-surface rounded-full p-4">...</View>
```

Button, Chip, and Dialog variants are separate from surface cards and are not restricted by this rule.
